<section class="architecture-board" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
  <header>
    <div><span>Target architecture · Designed</span><h3 id="architecture-title">从统一接入到可信数据底座</h3></div>
    <p>按领域自治、事件驱动和故障隔离拆分边界；当前 MVP 保持模块化单体，按业务压力渐进迁移。</p>
  </header>

  <div class="layers">
    <section class="layer access"><b>接入层</b><div><span>HarmonyOS</span><span>运营管理端</span><span>外部 Agent / OpenAPI</span></div></section>
    <i>↓</i>
    <section class="layer gateway"><b>统一网关</b><div><span>HTTPS / WSS</span><span>JWT / HMAC</span><span>动态路由</span><span>限流熔断</span><span>审计追踪</span></div></section>
    <i>↓</i>
    <section class="layer domains"><b>领域服务</b><div><span>用户与认证</span><span>任务与审核</span><span>Agent 能力</span><span>多 Agent 调度</span><span>订单履约</span><span>交易账务</span><span>文件证据</span><span>通知风控</span></div></section>
    <i>↓</i>
    <section class="layer data"><b>事件与数据</b><div><span>RocketMQ</span><span>Redis Cluster</span><span>openGauss</span><span>对象存储</span><span>检索与审计</span></div></section>
    <i>↓</i>
    <section class="layer infra"><b>云原生基础设施</b><div><span>华为云 / EulerOS</span><span>Kubernetes</span><span>CI/CD</span><span>服务治理</span><span>可观测性</span></div></section>
  </div>

  <footer><span>同步调用完成查询</span><span>领域事件解耦写链路</span><span>治理链路不承载核心业务数据</span></footer>
</section>

<style>
  .architecture-board { width:min(calc(100vw - 2rem),var(--content-width)); margin:var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-8) 50%; padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem); border:1px solid var(--color-border-strong); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); background:var(--product-surface,rgba(255,251,243,.78)); box-shadow:var(--shadow-card); transform:translateX(-50%); }
  header { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr minmax(16rem,.75fr); gap:var(--space-6); align-items:end; margin-bottom:var(--space-5); }
  header span { color:var(--product-accent,var(--color-accent-strong)); font:750 .64rem var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  h3 { margin:var(--space-2) 0 0; font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.4rem); }
  header p { margin:0; color:var(--color-text-soft); font-size:.8rem; }
  .layers { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; }
  .layers > i { height:1.5rem; color:var(--product-accent,var(--color-accent-strong)); font-style:normal; line-height:1.5rem; }
  .layer { display:grid; width:100%; grid-template-columns:8rem 1fr; gap:var(--space-4); align-items:center; padding:var(--space-3); border:1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); background:rgba(255,255,255,.5); }
  .layer b { padding-left:var(--space-2); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.9rem; }
  .layer div { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(7rem,1fr)); gap:var(--space-2); }
  .layer span { padding:.55rem .45rem; border-radius:.55rem; text-align:center; font-size:.67rem; background:rgba(189,150,81,.06); }
  .gateway { border-color:rgba(143,106,44,.2); }
  .gateway span { background:var(--color-accent-soft); }
  .domains { border-color:rgba(143,106,44,.24); }
  .domains span { background:rgba(189,150,81,.13); }
  .data { border-color:rgba(121,104,73,.2); }
  .data span { background:rgba(121,104,73,.09); }
  .infra { border-color:rgba(110,112,79,.2); }
  .infra span { background:rgba(110,112,79,.08); }
  footer { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; gap:var(--space-2); margin-top:var(--space-5); }
  footer span { padding:.35rem .65rem; border-radius:999px; color:var(--color-text-soft); background:var(--color-bg-soft); font-size:.65rem; }
  @media(max-width:760px){.architecture-board{width:calc(100vw - 1.25rem)} header{grid-template-columns:1fr}.layer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.layer b{padding:0}.layer div{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
</style>
